, Cheng, X., Taylor, P., McCammon, J. A., and Sine, S. M. (<year>2008</year>) <source>PloS Comput. Biol.</source> <volume>4</volume> <fpage>e41</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18282090</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref48"><label>48</label><citation citation-type="journal">Tapia, L., Kuryatov, A., and Lindstrom, J. (<year>2007</year>) <source>Mol. Pharmacol.</source> <volume>71</volume> <fpage>769</fpage>&#x02013;776<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17132685</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref49"><label>49</label><citation citation-type="journal">Panicker, S., Cruz, H., Arrabit, C., and Slesinger, P. A. (<year>2002</year>) <source>J. Neurosci.</source> <volume>22</volume> <fpage>1629</fpage>&#x02013;1639<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11880493</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref50"><label>50</label><citation citation-type="journal">Hilf, R. J. C., and Dutzler, R. (<year>2008</year>) <source>Nature</source> <volume>452</volume> <fpage>375</fpage>&#x02013;379<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18322461</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref51"><label>51</label><citation citation-type="journal">Belleli, D., Balcarek, J. M., Hope, A. G., Peters, J. A., Lambert, J. J., and Blackburn, T. P. (<year>1995</year>) <source>Mol. Pharmacol.</source> <volume>48</volume> <fpage>1054</fpage>&#x02013;1062<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8848005</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn id="fn5"><label>4</label><p>The abbreviations used are: 5-HT, 5-hydroxytryptamine; ACh, acetylcholine; MA, membrane-associated; TM, transmembrane; pS, picosiemens; HEK, human embryonic kidney; <italic>I</italic>-<italic>V</italic>, whole-cell current-voltage relationship; <italic>i</italic>-<italic>V</italic>, single channel current-voltage relationship.</p></fn><fn id="fn6"><label>5</label><p>M. R. Livesey, M. A. Cooper, T. Z. Deeb, J. E. Carland, J. Kozuska, T. G. Hales, J. J. Lambert, and J. A. Peters, unpublished observations.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>